# The Eidetic Contextual Memory Matrix Code

This document outlines the TypeScript code for the Eidetic Contextual Memory Matrix (ECM), a core component designed for
advanced memory management and contextual retrieval within the Phoenix architecture. The ECM facilitates efficient
storage, retrieval, and contextualization of diverse data types, forming the basis for the Cognitive Loom's long-term
memory.

# 1\. `EideticMemoryMatrix.ts` (Core Matrix Logic)

This file defines the primary structure and methods for the Eidetic Contextual Memory Matrix, handling the creation,
retrieval, updating, and deletion of memory fragments, as well as managing their contextual relationships.

